/**
 * =====================================================================
 *  JAIN & LUNKAD — FI / CPV Verification · Google Apps Script backend
 * =====================================================================
 *  Google Sheet = database. This script = secure API + notifications.
 *
 *  Security model
 *   - API_TOKEN       : shared app secret (also in the app's .env).
 *   - Session tokens  : issued at login, 6h sliding expiry (CacheService).
 *   - Roles           : ADMIN / REVIEWER / FIELD_EXEC, re-read from the
 *                       Login sheet on EVERY request (deactivate a user or
 *                       change a role and it applies immediately).
 *   - Case ownership  : a FIELD_EXEC can only read / edit cases assigned
 *                       to them — enforced here, not just in the UI.
 *   - Passwords       : SHA-256 hashed; 5 wrong tries = 15 min lockout.
 *   - Photos          : stored PRIVATE in Drive; served only through
 *                       getFile after an access check.
 *   - Telegram token  : Script Properties (never in the sheet).
 *   - Audit sheet     : every login / create / edit / submit / approve /
 *                       send-back / report generation.
 *
 *  FIRST-TIME SETUP (see SETUP-GUIDE.md for screenshots-level detail)
 *   1. Create a blank Google Sheet → Extensions → Apps Script.
 *   2. Paste this file. Set API_TOKEN below (long random string).
 *   3. Select function "setup" → Run → allow permissions.
 *      (creates all tabs + default admin  admin / admin123)
 *   4. Deploy → New deployment → Web app
 *        Execute as: Me      Who has access: Anyone
 *      Copy the /exec URL into the app's .env (VITE_APPSCRIPT_URL).
 *   Re-deploy (Manage deployments → Edit → New version) after any change.
 * =====================================================================
 */

